  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deadly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\" I am like \"What the hack? I'm dying!\" and the bee says \"I'm not going to let you die, my Queen. I'm here to save you.\" I'm like \"What?\" and the bee says \"I'm a bee servant, your Majesty.\" I asked \"A bee servant?\" and the bee says \"Yes, I'm a bee that was born with the ability to understand human speech. Just give me commands\" I'm like \"I don't know what to say\" and the bee says \"Just say anything, my Queen.\"",
